to live in an illusion
than it is in reality.


01:17:50.373 --> 01:17:53.911
What is this thing
called "love" anyway?


01:17:53.944 --> 01:17:55.846
Did I ever give enough of it?


01:17:58.349 --> 01:17:59.850
Does anyone?


01:18:02.953 --> 01:18:05.922
I thought everything made sense,


01:18:05.956 --> 01:18:08.426
but none of this does now.


01:18:10.094 --> 01:18:12.095
I thought I was in control.


01:18:12.128 --> 01:18:14.332
But I'm not.


01:18:17.067 --> 01:18:21.005
How the hell am I
the last man alive?


01:18:22.338 --> 01:18:24.775
How the hell has that happened?


01:18:32.048 --> 01:18:33.784
Emma.


01:18:37.054 --> 01:18:40.190
Recording interrupted.


01:18:40.224 --> 01:18:43.427
David, you have
run out of storage space.


01:18:48.231 --> 01:18:50.301
Last saved recording.


01:18:50.333 --> 01:18:54.072
Whenever you see
a star twinkling...


01:18:56.073 --> 01:19:00.145
that would be me
just changing a bulb.


01:19:04.280 --> 01:19:06.050
I love you forever.


01:19:07.251 --> 01:19:09.253
I love you forever.


01:19:10.320 --> 01:19:11.956
I love you for...


01:19:18.895 --> 01:19:20.899
I love you, too.


01:19:45.989 --> 01:19:49.993
David, this is God.


01:19:50.027 --> 01:19:53.530
I know you think I didn't,
but I did hear your prayers.


01:19:53.564 --> 01:19:57.467
I'm sorry, it's been
pretty hectic around here.


01:19:57.501 --> 01:19:59.436
But I'm here for you now.


01:19:59.470 --> 01:20:02.140
My child, how may I help you?


01:20:03.539 --> 01:20:06.344
Are you fucking kidding me?
